ng pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">To sell &amp; make jam</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.64.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 13th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"A brown fruit with a green inside! Some even say that Kiwi birds are made out of these things.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Kiwi</b> is an item that can be found on bushes on <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>.\n</p><p>It may be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\">Jer Junkman</a> for $180 per <b>Kiwi</b>. In its jam form it may be sold for $720\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by ~1.19% per kiwi.\n</p><p>As of August 12, the <b>Kiwi</b> is the latest fruit to be added to <a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands_Wiki\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\">Oaklands</a> and was intended to be a 'mystery fruit' for players to find themselves. It took the community 6 minutes to find it.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902162635\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019391/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.033      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   21.033      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3213-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902162635 and revision id 18634. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Fruits"],"links":[{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true},{"title":"Oaklands Wiki","exists":true}],"images":["KiwiFruit.png"]}
